bda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (1-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )-2(-1) & =0 \\\\ 1-2\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+2 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-2\\lambda +3 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{-b\\pm \\sqrt{{b}^{2}-4ac}}{2a} \\\\  & =\\frac{-(-2)\\pm \\sqrt{(-2)^{2}-4(1)(3)}}{2(1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\pm \\sqrt{-8}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\pm 2\\text{i}\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =1\\pm \\text{i}\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =1\\pm \\text{i}\\sqrt{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-81022/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7a453400-6363-5782-b346-aae37570c9bc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81022"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103534/selection/f509030681214332b5989836fe0af4b2eb5858d193e689fd8441dff5cd45ff45" :answer/id #uuid "1fb4e09a-d5a6-5518-baef-b8570fc9ef0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103534/selection/c9470aafa189cdabc1f0fad8fb48b4c151ea20f8f211261826dd93d15e6beb1b" :answer/id #uuid "a66c47d4-b9b4-5605-bd45-e9b8849ca086" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103534/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "89c2f557-cb7e-5a7b-8091-d9cfde810fd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103534/selection/eba7fb9cb4be54964d8fe1d1adda24ada9c039f0812a79a13a604e783119959e" :answer/id #uuid "3a340b43-f7c0-5e21-9d19-9745149cde37" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-18\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103534/selection/89e34329534b6ee904fc166b9ee2a8f587c79161a7c80fc821ab136e40774c36" :answer/id #uuid "e190183d-abfa-5662-b490-285076dc6648" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{16}{3}" :db/ensure [:answ